WEBVTT

01:21.879 --> 01:23.979
Oh, that's beautiful.

01:24.048 --> 01:25.846
It was terrible.
I can't do it.

01:25.915 --> 01:27.548
Hmm, not yet.

01:29.017 --> 01:30.012
But you will.

01:35.762 --> 01:37.420
You're growing up so fast.

01:37.489 --> 01:38.862
You say that all the time.

01:38.930 --> 01:40.594
Yeah, it's because you are.

01:44.168 --> 01:45.896
You look so much
like your sister.

01:51.107 --> 01:52.771
I wish I could remember her.

02:01.121 --> 02:03.045
If I come back
and you're a foot taller...

02:04.548 --> 02:05.652
gonna ground you.

04:10.308 --> 04:12.007
Shh.

04:12.075 --> 04:14.044
Remember what
we learned, okay?

04:36.667 --> 04:37.903
Eve, come with me.

04:42.881 --> 04:43.876
Stay quiet.

06:00.425 --> 06:02.526
We opened our hearts to you.

06:03.522 --> 06:06.128
We embraced you.

06:06.196 --> 06:08.967
We let you, an outsider,

06:09.036 --> 06:11.895
marry a daughter of our clan.

06:11.964 --> 06:14.296
And how did you repay
this kindness?

06:16.309 --> 06:18.971
You took
what was not rightfully yours.

06:20.112 --> 06:22.574
And now, your wife is dead,

06:22.643 --> 06:26.042
to atone
for your transgressions.

06:26.111 --> 06:29.245
Did you think that
you could just walk away?

06:30.019 --> 06:31.016
Hmm?

06:33.189 --> 06:34.217
Where is she?

06:34.960 --> 06:36.153
Where is Eve?

06:40.327 --> 06:41.664
Charming.

06:50.174 --> 06:51.773
You're a fucking coward.

06:53.004 --> 06:54.311
You're trying
to convince yourself

06:54.380 --> 06:57.180
that fate absolves you
of your actions.

06:57.249 --> 06:59.778
-There are no choices.
-Yeah.

06:59.847 --> 07:02.349
Does that make
what you do any easier?

07:02.417 --> 07:04.016
It makes what I do...

07:05.220 --> 07:06.282
necessary.

07:15.726 --> 07:17.568
One bullet...

07:18.938 --> 07:19.933
well placed...

07:22.569 --> 07:24.366
can be a magical thing.

07:25.836 --> 07:26.808
It's neither good...

07:28.012 --> 07:28.975
nor evil.

07:30.511 --> 07:32.308
But how a man uses it

07:33.350 --> 07:35.146
reveals his true character.

07:39.586 --> 07:40.822
You wanted choices.

07:42.094 --> 07:43.253
Well, here they are.

07:44.096 --> 07:45.321
You kill yourself,

07:46.461 --> 07:47.664
and your daughter lives.

07:49.430 --> 07:50.797
Or kill me,

07:50.865 --> 07:53.670
and you and your daughter
die together.

07:57.075 --> 07:58.741
Choice is yours.

08:11.123 --> 08:13.049
You've got your choice.

08:13.117 --> 08:15.450
Now, do you have
the balls to do it?

08:26.234 --> 08:27.198
Papa!

09:28.665 --> 09:30.663
Hey, baby, look at me.

09:30.731 --> 09:32.197
It's okay.

09:36.005 --> 09:37.974
Come on.

10:06.906 --> 10:07.969
Come on.

10:44.240 --> 10:45.237
Papa.

10:47.609 --> 10:49.172
I'm sorry, honey.

10:49.241 --> 10:51.980
-I never wanted this for you.
-Papa.

10:53.943 --> 10:54.950
I'm sorry.

10:58.485 --> 10:59.482
Papa!

11:00.322 --> 11:01.319
Papa...

12:04.315 --> 12:07.726
Tchaikovsky.
How lovely.

12:16.995 --> 12:18.095
At a time of loss,

12:18.164 --> 12:20.495
there's nothing easier
than pity

12:20.563 --> 12:22.738
and nothing more difficult
than the truth,

12:22.807 --> 12:25.601
as there are no easy answers
for grief.

12:26.678 --> 12:28.505
I'd like to be honest
with you.

12:30.173 --> 12:31.673
Would that be all right?

12:46.927 --> 12:48.932
Your father was a good man.

12:51.902 --> 12:55.598
He wanted a free
and open life for you.

12:57.501 --> 13:00.812
Not like the one that
he had to endure.

13:02.408 --> 13:06.081
But we all live
with the decisions we make.

13:08.950 --> 13:10.949
Now he's been taken from you.

13:11.017 --> 13:13.649
I can do nothing about that.

13:15.592 --> 13:17.125
But what I can do...

13:18.224 --> 13:20.392
is offer to take you
to his family.

13:21.565 --> 13:22.966
They will look after you

13:23.963 --> 13:26.332
and, hopefully...

13:27.299 --> 13:29.808
one day become
your family, too.

14:47.950 --> 14:49.745
The Director will see you now.

15:01.197 --> 15:03.363
Does she know
who her parents really were?

15:18.879 --> 15:20.050
Come here. Sit.

15:25.853 --> 15:27.123
You dance, yes?

15:28.722 --> 15:29.756
Mmm-hmm.

15:29.825 --> 15:31.226
I run this theater,

15:32.689 --> 15:35.197
and I am always looking
for new recruits.

15:40.032 --> 15:41.038
I know you.

15:42.200 --> 15:44.270
I know your pain.

15:44.338 --> 15:47.242
What boils inside of you
under the surface.

15:49.915 --> 15:52.412
I can give you somewhere
to put that anger.

15:54.180 --> 15:56.214
Those men took your past.

15:56.283 --> 15:58.451
Don't let them
steal your future.

16:12.634 --> 16:14.330
Well?

16:14.398 --> 16:16.297
She says my path is now here

16:16.366 --> 16:17.833
with the Ruska Roma.

16:22.074 --> 16:23.113
Very well...

16:24.415 --> 16:25.412
Eve.

16:28.554 --> 16:30.348
Thank you, Mr. Winston.

16:30.417 --> 16:33.849
You are most welcome,
Miss MaCarro.

16:41.661 --> 16:45.003
And know that I will
always be at your service.

17:02.279 --> 17:04.588
My name is Nogi.

17:04.656 --> 17:05.947
Did you know my father?

17:06.985 --> 17:07.982
I did.

17:12.590 --> 17:15.528
Your father was Ruska Roma,
like me.

17:16.261 --> 17:17.629
Like you will be, too.

17:21.037 --> 17:23.470
He was what we call Kikimora.

17:24.301 --> 17:25.773
What is that?

17:25.842 --> 17:27.777
In Slavic mythology,

17:27.846 --> 17:30.705
the Kikimora is
a kind of spirit

17:30.774 --> 17:34.214
to those with darkness
in their hearts.

17:34.282 --> 17:37.752
She can be vengeful
and destructive.

17:37.821 --> 17:40.355
Like the boogeyman?

17:41.624 --> 17:42.588
Yes.

17:44.322 --> 17:45.987
But to the innocent...

17:47.226 --> 17:48.858
she can be a protector.

17:54.967 --> 17:55.931
It is...

17:57.873 --> 17:59.110
two sides...

18:00.579 --> 18:01.904
to the one coin.

18:03.207 --> 18:04.214
To kill...

18:09.014 --> 18:10.011
To save.

18:13.054 --> 18:16.259
But, ultimately...

18:20.865 --> 18:23.101
it is up to you to choose.

19:28.329 --> 19:29.827
Are you finished?

19:31.428 --> 19:32.929
No.

19:33.472 --> 19:34.502
Good.

19:35.335 --> 19:37.338
That will be all for today.

19:37.407 --> 19:39.833
Tend to your wounds
before you get sepsis,

19:39.902 --> 19:41.910
and we have to
cut off your feet.

19:41.978 --> 19:43.973
Tell Tatiana she's next.

20:13.872 --> 20:15.972
"Her Majesty" says you're up.

20:17.013 --> 20:18.513
That woman hates me.

20:19.983 --> 20:21.384
She hates everybody.

20:27.452 --> 20:29.124
Christ, Eve.

20:29.193 --> 20:31.185
Why do you
push yourself like this?

20:32.732 --> 20:33.990
I want to be ready.

20:35.030 --> 20:36.025
Ready for what?

20:39.695 --> 20:41.101
You know what's funny?

20:41.170 --> 20:42.337
When I was a little girl,

20:42.406 --> 20:44.137
I actually did want
to be a real ballerina.

20:44.206 --> 20:46.101
You are a real ballerina.

20:47.308 --> 20:49.839
You're the best dancer here.

20:49.908 --> 20:51.744
That other shit,
you'll learn with training.

21:12.068 --> 21:13.227
Fire!

21:16.335 --> 21:17.473
One bullet,

21:18.007 --> 21:19.205
well placed,

21:19.273 --> 21:21.444
can change the world.

21:27.881 --> 21:31.916
The Kikimora's purpose is
to stop that bullet.

21:40.030 --> 21:40.991
Time's up!

21:46.064 --> 21:51.338
To become Kikimora
you must become the assassin.

21:51.407 --> 21:53.844
<i> You must learn</i>
<i> to move like him</i>

21:53.912 --> 21:55.676
<i> and think like him.</i>

21:59.082 --> 22:00.809
For this next exercise,

22:00.878 --> 22:04.051
we will be using
simulated rounds.

22:04.120 --> 22:05.418
What are the rules?

22:05.487 --> 22:08.920
Protect your ward
at all costs.

22:10.126 --> 22:12.330
<i> That is the only rule.</i>

22:45.964 --> 22:47.123
Why did you fail?

22:47.932 --> 22:49.230
He's too strong.

22:49.298 --> 22:50.694
Do you really believe

22:50.763 --> 22:52.299
that strength
has anything to do

22:52.368 --> 22:54.036
with whether you win or lose?

22:54.105 --> 22:56.165
You will always be weaker.

22:57.707 --> 23:00.477
You will always be smaller
and at a disadvantage.

23:02.277 --> 23:03.541
He is beating you

23:03.609 --> 23:04.907
because you are allowing him

23:04.975 --> 23:07.308
to define the terms
of the contest.

23:08.183 --> 23:09.244
You want to win?

23:12.782 --> 23:15.019
Change the terms.

23:16.687 --> 23:19.727
Improvise, adapt, cheat.

23:20.560 --> 23:23.401
Lean into your strengths,

23:23.999 --> 23:25.062
not his.

23:29.799 --> 23:31.035
Fight like a girl.

23:36.242 --> 23:37.443
Begin.

24:14.214 --> 24:15.310
Good.

24:38.141 --> 24:39.136
Where is she?

24:41.141 --> 24:43.910
Tatiana's things are gone.
Did something happen to her?

24:47.918 --> 24:48.915
Sit.

24:55.758 --> 24:58.525
Tatiana did not have
the qualities required

24:58.594 --> 25:00.454
to continue
with the Ruska Roma.

25:02.398 --> 25:04.533
What are you talking about?

25:04.602 --> 25:06.801
She lacked the killer instinct
I see in you.

25:07.634 --> 25:09.133
Your childhood was taken.

25:10.242 --> 25:12.301
This pain is what drives you.

25:13.439 --> 25:14.936
Tatiana...

25:15.004 --> 25:17.938
there is sadness, not pain.

25:18.006 --> 25:19.374
There's a difference.

25:20.748 --> 25:22.652
You two are now
on different paths.

25:23.684 --> 25:25.622
Then why are you
holding me back?

25:28.355 --> 25:29.384
I'm ready.

25:31.195 --> 25:32.387
Perhaps you are right.

25:37.596 --> 25:38.668
It is time.

25:45.840 --> 25:48.403
This is the final stage
of your training.

26:11.663 --> 26:12.900
Oh, my God.

26:14.734 --> 26:16.332
Are you fucking kidding me?

26:17.373 --> 26:19.104
I'm a fucking test?

26:20.344 --> 26:22.404
How the mighty have fallen.

26:29.583 --> 26:31.050
Do you know who I am?

26:32.550 --> 26:33.547
No.

26:34.993 --> 26:35.956
I'm you...

26:37.261 --> 26:39.388
in ten fucking years.

27:53.562 --> 27:56.033
Somehow
you managed to get out,

27:56.102 --> 27:58.533
but here you are back
where you began.

28:01.279 --> 28:02.603
All of this for what?

28:21.764 --> 28:23.595
With this, Jardani,

28:23.664 --> 28:25.296
your ticket is torn.

28:32.942 --> 28:34.745
You can never come home again.

28:36.777 --> 28:38.507
Take him to the lifeboat.

28:40.614 --> 28:41.752
<i> Do svidanya.</i>

28:45.223 --> 28:46.856
<i> Das vedanya.</i>

28:55.530 --> 28:56.525
You're him.

28:57.866 --> 28:59.770
The one they call
the Baba Yaga.

29:08.305 --> 29:10.407
The students
all talk about you.

29:14.913 --> 29:16.215
How do I get outta here?

29:18.313 --> 29:20.450
The front door is unlocked.

29:21.853 --> 29:23.460
No. I mean...

29:23.529 --> 29:26.555
how do I start doing
what you do?

29:29.533 --> 29:31.296
Looks like you already have.

29:32.495 --> 29:35.700
That door will lock sooner
than you think.

29:35.769 --> 29:37.104
You can still leave.

29:38.343 --> 29:39.975
You still have a choice.

29:44.008 --> 29:45.574
Why didn't you leave?

29:48.452 --> 29:49.710
I'm working on it.

29:55.892 --> 29:57.822
NOGI:<i> The Director feels</i>
<i> you are ready</i>

29:57.890 --> 29:59.423
for your first contract.

30:01.466 --> 30:03.559
You will protect this woman.

30:04.368 --> 30:05.459
Katla Park.

30:05.527 --> 30:08.462
Her father is
our primary charge.

30:08.530 --> 30:11.005
He is concerned that
his competitors

30:11.074 --> 30:14.701
may try to get to him
by ransoming his daughter.

30:14.770 --> 30:17.672
Your job is to make sure
they don't get the chance.

30:18.582 --> 30:19.915
To infiltrate past security,

30:19.984 --> 30:24.687
you'll be using a modified
3D printed Glock 43X

30:24.755 --> 30:27.422
with reinforced
carbon fiber barrel,

30:27.491 --> 30:28.749
and polymer rounds.

30:32.924 --> 30:34.029
Rubber bullets?

30:34.924 --> 30:35.932
Problem?

30:38.504 --> 30:40.533
-No.
-You'll find Miss Park

30:40.602 --> 30:42.202
at Minus Eleven.

31:58.581 --> 31:59.576
In position.

32:00.352 --> 32:01.347
NOGI:<i> Copy.</i>

32:02.247 --> 32:03.921
I have the principal in sight.

32:06.250 --> 32:07.848
NOGI:<i> Hold your position.</i>

32:09.493 --> 32:10.455
She can dance.

32:21.838 --> 32:23.941
I got movement at ten o'clock.

32:25.410 --> 32:26.537
NOGI:<i> A threat?</i>

32:27.774 --> 32:29.111
Stand by.

32:35.717 --> 32:37.310
Hey!

32:37.379 --> 32:38.813
Definitely a threat.

32:58.138 --> 33:00.375
You should get out of the way.

33:00.443 --> 33:01.440
I can't.

33:03.778 --> 33:05.609
I understand.

35:01.894 --> 35:02.891
Hey!

36:39.422 --> 36:41.064
No, no, no.

36:41.133 --> 36:42.797
I don't want anyone
to touch me right now.

36:42.866 --> 36:44.531
Hey, hey. It's okay.

36:45.430 --> 36:46.401
You're safe now, it's fine.

36:47.872 --> 36:49.030
Let's get you out of here.

38:47.051 --> 38:49.418
MAN:<i> Hey, what the hell is</i>
<i> goin' on up there?</i>

38:49.487 --> 38:50.690
<i> Somebody respond.</i>

39:17.418 --> 39:18.746
Were you stuck
in the elevator?

39:20.452 --> 39:22.623
Yes. It was very scary.

41:49.770 --> 41:52.674
Miss, something's leaking
from your bag.

41:56.310 --> 41:57.440
Yes. Thank you.

41:57.509 --> 41:58.548
No problem.

42:05.689 --> 42:08.617
Is there a reason you've
brought me a severed hand?

42:08.686 --> 42:09.691
Look at the scar.

42:12.987 --> 42:14.157
I've seen this before.

42:14.923 --> 42:16.265
That's the same scar

42:16.334 --> 42:18.266
as the man
who murdered my father.

42:18.334 --> 42:20.465
It was a mark from a tribe.

42:20.533 --> 42:22.465
You knew who they were.

42:22.534 --> 42:23.573
How dare you?

42:24.439 --> 42:26.199
I have been protecting you.

42:26.268 --> 42:29.102
Why didn't you tell me
who they were?

42:29.171 --> 42:31.542
My child,
you do not understand.

42:31.610 --> 42:33.142
People with that mark,

42:33.211 --> 42:37.145
they have no rules,
no consequence, no mercy.

42:37.213 --> 42:38.981
They do not interfere
with our business,

42:39.049 --> 42:41.050
and we do not interfere
with theirs.

42:41.119 --> 42:44.558
This is a pact as old as
the Ruska Roma itself.

42:44.627 --> 42:47.063
All these rules,
who are they serving?

42:47.131 --> 42:49.395
When you deal in blood,

42:49.463 --> 42:50.600
there must be rules...

42:51.732 --> 42:54.063
or nothing survives.

42:54.131 --> 42:56.236
Why would a tribe
try to kidnap a child?

42:56.305 --> 42:57.997
I am warning you,

42:58.065 --> 42:59.937
you will not find them,

43:00.006 --> 43:02.902
and hunting for them
will only bring chaos.

43:02.971 --> 43:05.179
I'm ordering you,

43:05.248 --> 43:07.446
do not pursue this.

43:07.514 --> 43:09.586
Do I make myself clear?

43:19.427 --> 43:20.421
Please...

43:22.396 --> 43:23.556
take your hand.

44:03.274 --> 44:04.402
Welcome to the Continental.

44:04.471 --> 44:05.970
Checking in?

44:06.038 --> 44:09.210
No. I'd like to speak
with the manager.

44:09.279 --> 44:11.013
Is he expecting you?

44:11.082 --> 44:12.310
No, he's not.

44:12.378 --> 44:13.878
I see.

44:13.946 --> 44:15.509
And what, may I ask,
is your name?

44:16.646 --> 44:17.679
Eve.

44:17.748 --> 44:18.919
Eve MaCarro.

44:23.118 --> 44:24.920
Let me see what I can do.

44:38.904 --> 44:41.542
Eve MaCarro of the Ruska Roma.

44:41.611 --> 44:44.340
What a pleasure
to see you again.

44:47.116 --> 44:48.113
Please.

44:57.251 --> 44:58.893
So, what brings you here?

45:01.491 --> 45:04.300
I'm looking for the tribe
that killed my father.

45:04.369 --> 45:07.196
And if I suggested you didn't?

45:07.265 --> 45:10.333
I would smile and nod
and then ignore you.

45:11.008 --> 45:13.037
Ah.

45:13.106 --> 45:15.275
The Director has already
warned me about them

45:15.344 --> 45:17.106
and the rules.

45:17.174 --> 45:18.907
So, I can appreciate
your reluctance.

45:18.975 --> 45:20.782
That's very kind of you,

45:20.851 --> 45:24.885
but a few words of advice,
if I may, Miss MaCarro.

45:24.954 --> 45:27.580
Whatever information
you think these people have,

45:27.649 --> 45:31.354
it might not be in your
best interests to know it.

45:32.219 --> 45:33.761
I still need to know.

45:33.829 --> 45:36.232
"Needing to know"
is what got us banished

45:36.300 --> 45:37.591
from the Garden of Eden.

45:38.801 --> 45:42.365
Are you prepared
to be cast out again, Eve?

45:52.412 --> 45:53.409
Please.

45:59.684 --> 46:00.680
Very well.

46:03.388 --> 46:07.155
I'll give you this.
It's not a tribe, it's a cult.

46:07.224 --> 46:10.132
That kills
not just for business,

46:10.201 --> 46:12.163
but for sport.

46:12.232 --> 46:15.500
While we live among
so-called polite society,

46:15.569 --> 46:16.635
they do not.

46:16.703 --> 46:18.672
Where can I find them?

46:18.741 --> 46:22.669
The precise location
is unknown.

46:22.738 --> 46:25.614
But we do monitor them
when they stay at our hotels.

46:25.682 --> 46:27.708
They have access
to the Continentals?

46:27.777 --> 46:32.046
Oh, yes. Better to have them
inside the tent, pissing out,

46:32.115 --> 46:35.449
than outside, pissing in.

46:35.518 --> 46:38.453
And, yes, there is a man
who bears that mark

46:38.522 --> 46:41.363
staying at one of our hotels
at the present...

46:41.431 --> 46:42.990
in Prague, I believe.

46:43.059 --> 46:44.658
On what business?

46:51.274 --> 46:52.435
Shall we?

47:07.588 --> 47:08.653
Hello, my dear.

47:08.722 --> 47:10.187
Muriel, be a darling

47:10.256 --> 47:12.756
and bring up the latest
Blackwire submissions

47:12.825 --> 47:14.490
on a Daniel Pine.

47:17.763 --> 47:19.392
Daniel Pine...

47:19.461 --> 47:21.361
Contract submitted
three days ago.

47:21.430 --> 47:23.335
His bounty is set
at two million.

47:23.403 --> 47:25.537
He's currently holed up inside
the Prague Continental...

47:25.606 --> 47:27.877
<i> room 3-1-5.</i>

47:29.273 --> 47:32.177
No outside calls
have been logged,

47:32.246 --> 47:35.775
and he's purchased
a shitload of room service.

47:36.585 --> 47:37.612
Mostly ice cream.

47:38.521 --> 47:39.779
Sweet tooth, hmm?

47:40.787 --> 47:41.786
Hard copy, please.

47:54.965 --> 47:55.971
Sir...

47:56.869 --> 47:57.973
there is a call for you.

47:58.772 --> 48:00.239
From The Director.

49:10.538 --> 49:12.707
Checking in.

49:13.350 --> 49:14.542
Certainly.

49:14.610 --> 49:17.044
And how long
will you be staying with us?

49:17.113 --> 49:18.251
Just the night.

49:20.381 --> 49:22.816
Room 314, please.

49:45.950 --> 49:47.648
<i> Still no movement from Pine.</i>

49:47.716 --> 49:49.475
<i> What are my orders?</i>

49:49.544 --> 49:51.146
LENA:<i> Keep your eyes on Pine.</i>

49:51.214 --> 49:52.450
<i> We may have a taker.</i>

50:08.638 --> 50:09.932
You're right.

50:10.001 --> 50:12.167
We have a taker.

50:12.236 --> 50:14.835
A woman, young, dark hair.

50:18.107 --> 50:19.477
She's in.

50:45.608 --> 50:46.570
Who are you?

50:49.005 --> 50:50.879
Shit.

50:50.948 --> 50:53.049
You're not supposed
to say that word.

50:54.815 --> 50:56.481
Right. Sorry.

50:57.512 --> 50:59.649
-What's your name?
-Ella.

51:00.280 --> 51:01.891
I'm Eve.

51:01.959 --> 51:04.225
You're not here
to hurt my daddy, are you?

51:06.728 --> 51:07.723
Your father?

51:23.206 --> 51:25.077
Ella, come here.

51:25.146 --> 51:26.345
Everything's gonna
be all right.

51:26.414 --> 51:28.117
Why don't you come
stand behind me, sweetheart?

51:32.920 --> 51:33.947
What do you want?

51:36.594 --> 51:37.651
When I was a child,

51:37.720 --> 51:39.953
men with your mark
murdered my father.

51:41.328 --> 51:43.055
I just want to know
where to find them.

51:46.831 --> 51:49.303
You have no idea what you
just walked into, do you?

51:55.845 --> 51:57.476
No business being conducted.

51:58.243 --> 51:59.313
<i> They're just talking.</i>

52:06.548 --> 52:07.651
WOMAN:<i> Contract services.</i>

52:08.516 --> 52:09.656
How can I help you?

52:09.725 --> 52:11.952
Account 8-6-5-1.

52:12.630 --> 52:13.954
<i> Name on contract?</i>

52:15.291 --> 52:16.660
Daniel Pine.

52:19.032 --> 52:20.059
<i> Double the contract.</i>

52:48.161 --> 52:49.363
Fuck.

52:50.628 --> 52:53.529
You just made everything
a whole lot worse.

52:53.598 --> 52:55.565
Those people that
you're looking for?

52:55.634 --> 52:57.998
They're surrounding
this hotel right now,

52:58.067 --> 53:01.068
hoping somebody breaks
the rules and takes the bait.

53:01.136 --> 53:03.875
I think they were hoping that
somebody was gonna be you.

53:07.841 --> 53:09.350
Now, you've just
made 'em antsy.

53:15.421 --> 53:17.289
Why would they be
at the hotel?

53:17.358 --> 53:18.722
They just want me dead
to get to her.

53:34.711 --> 53:36.509
Baby, stay down!

53:53.160 --> 53:54.153
Ella, come on.

54:00.064 --> 54:01.061
Come on.

54:04.533 --> 54:06.506
He's moving. Hallway.

54:42.678 --> 54:43.873
Damn it!

54:45.043 --> 54:46.110
Come on.

54:52.584 --> 54:54.147
Back, back,
back the other way. Go!

54:55.684 --> 54:56.985
Wait, wait. Get behind me.

54:58.056 --> 54:59.119
Come on.

55:40.497 --> 55:41.502
Ella, honey...

55:43.069 --> 55:44.032
let's go.

55:50.838 --> 55:51.941
Why do they want her?

55:52.981 --> 55:53.976
It's a cult.

55:54.950 --> 55:55.945
No one gets out.

55:56.785 --> 55:57.782
Ever.

56:03.359 --> 56:05.721
You gotta help me
get Ella outta here.

56:05.789 --> 56:07.457
She deserves
a better life than this.

56:07.526 --> 56:09.024
I can't.
That's not why I'm here.

56:09.833 --> 56:11.290
You're Kikimora.

56:12.166 --> 56:13.325
Isn't that what you do?

56:14.168 --> 56:16.061
Help me protect her.

56:16.129 --> 56:17.637
I'll tell you
where to find them.

56:20.138 --> 56:21.135
Please?

56:22.505 --> 56:23.511
Daddy...

56:24.772 --> 56:26.439
are we going to die?

56:26.508 --> 56:27.748
No.

56:27.817 --> 56:28.813
No, baby.

56:29.479 --> 56:30.584
No, not today.

56:33.319 --> 56:34.720
You can trust her.

57:15.393 --> 57:16.388
-Hi.
-Huh?

57:20.761 --> 57:21.800
It's okay.

57:27.210 --> 57:28.601
-Hey.
-How many left?

57:28.670 --> 57:29.971
Two. Maybe ten.

57:30.040 --> 57:31.880
Oh, fuck it.

57:55.867 --> 57:58.331
Daddy!

58:54.831 --> 58:55.828
Yes?

58:56.628 --> 58:57.698
LENA:<i> We have the girl.</i>

58:58.693 --> 59:00.368
<i> Good.</i>

59:00.436 --> 59:02.362
Sir, there was
someone else there.

59:03.664 --> 59:04.696
Who?

59:04.764 --> 59:05.871
A woman.

59:06.802 --> 59:08.537
For the contract?

59:08.606 --> 59:09.807
<i> I don't think so.</i>

59:09.876 --> 59:11.879
<i> I think she might</i>
<i> have been after Ella.</i>

59:11.947 --> 59:12.911
Really?

59:14.380 --> 59:15.848
Do we, uh...

59:17.043 --> 59:18.611
<i> Do we know who she is?</i>

59:18.679 --> 59:19.783
Not yet.

59:19.852 --> 59:22.217
<i> I left her</i>
<i> for Continental security.</i>

59:33.730 --> 59:34.867
They started this.

59:35.632 --> 59:36.770
That's bullshit.

59:38.307 --> 59:40.037
I did not break any rules.

59:41.502 --> 59:44.008
-You broke my fuckin' jaw.
-You're still using it.

59:45.643 --> 59:47.506
I didn't kill anyone.

59:58.219 --> 01:00:00.420
You're going to need
to check out.

01:00:02.329 --> 01:00:03.291
Understood.

01:00:26.852 --> 01:00:27.920
And what will it be today,
madam?

01:00:32.085 --> 01:00:33.420
I'd like to go hunting.

01:00:36.128 --> 01:00:38.557
Have you ever done business
with these people?

01:00:41.368 --> 01:00:42.398
I have not.

01:00:44.097 --> 01:00:46.364
But you know of them.

01:00:46.433 --> 01:00:48.644
You know more than me,
I assure you.

01:00:50.444 --> 01:00:51.812
May I be "frank"?

01:00:53.917 --> 01:00:54.914
Mmm-hmm.

01:00:56.243 --> 01:00:57.653
I prefer to keep it that way.

01:00:58.955 --> 01:01:00.048
Hmm.

01:01:00.116 --> 01:01:01.720
Are we just
window shopping today,

01:01:01.789 --> 01:01:03.582
or would you like
to make a purchase?

01:01:04.888 --> 01:01:06.453
Depends on the merchandise.

01:01:19.308 --> 01:01:20.368
After you, madam.

01:01:32.187 --> 01:01:33.183
Pardon me.

01:01:37.961 --> 01:01:39.528
So...

01:01:39.596 --> 01:01:42.126
will this be a large
or small game hunt?

01:01:44.660 --> 01:01:45.657
Large.

01:01:47.161 --> 01:01:49.765
The V Seven Harbinger TTI.

01:01:49.833 --> 01:01:51.234
Thirty rounds of .308.

01:01:51.303 --> 01:01:54.436
It's got a Trijicon AccuPoint
1-to-6 optical on top,

01:01:54.504 --> 01:01:57.603
and in case you wanna get
up close and make it personal,

01:01:57.672 --> 01:02:01.109
you've got a side RMR
for the faster, dirtier stuff.

01:02:01.178 --> 01:02:04.411
TTI custom Benelli
M2 21-inch fin grip.

01:02:04.480 --> 01:02:08.247
Oversized charging handle,
oversized bolt release.

01:02:08.316 --> 01:02:09.417
This will take
a bear's head off.

01:02:09.993 --> 01:02:10.990
Easily.

01:02:13.993 --> 01:02:16.055
Oh, this is
a personal favorite of mine.

01:02:16.124 --> 01:02:18.195
This...

01:02:27.704 --> 01:02:29.176
Ah! Fuck!

01:02:29.245 --> 01:02:30.240
Bastards! Fuck!

01:05:23.386 --> 01:05:24.546
Motherfuckers.

01:05:29.084 --> 01:05:30.855
All right...

01:05:30.924 --> 01:05:32.422
you didn't hear this from me.

01:05:37.924 --> 01:05:40.196
Their precise location
has never been confirmed,

01:05:40.264 --> 01:05:41.964
since anyone
who's ever gone looking

01:05:42.032 --> 01:05:43.367
has also gone missing.

01:05:44.033 --> 01:05:45.237
That's bad math.

01:05:45.901 --> 01:05:47.039
However,

01:05:47.108 --> 01:05:48.674
whispers suggest
they've been known to gather

01:05:48.743 --> 01:05:50.340
somewhere in these peaks,

01:05:50.409 --> 01:05:53.245
deep in the mountains
past Abersee and Feldkirk.

01:05:54.384 --> 01:05:55.373
It's not much.

01:05:55.441 --> 01:05:57.084
It's more than I had.

01:05:57.848 --> 01:05:58.811
Thank you.

01:06:01.920 --> 01:06:03.255
Sorry about your shop.

01:06:07.221 --> 01:06:08.227
I need a car.

01:07:05.856 --> 01:07:08.086
Did you think
I would not find out?

01:07:08.155 --> 01:07:10.591
That you expressly
disobeyed my orders?

01:07:10.660 --> 01:07:12.058
Then tell me who they are.

01:07:12.127 --> 01:07:14.359
<i> I told you,</i>
<i> we do not engage with them.</i>

01:07:14.427 --> 01:07:17.598
You risk the destruction
of our family, and for what?

01:07:17.667 --> 01:07:19.263
Your own selfish reasons.

01:07:19.331 --> 01:07:22.334
<i> Return at once</i>
<i> or I will have no choice.</i>

01:08:45.182 --> 01:08:46.484
Can I get you anything?

01:08:51.858 --> 01:08:53.084
Just a coffee.

01:09:04.466 --> 01:09:05.767
Come, let's go.

01:10:23.444 --> 01:10:24.446
It's Agnetha!

01:10:24.515 --> 01:10:26.045
Send somebody
to the restaurant!

01:10:26.489 --> 01:10:27.486
Hurry!

01:11:15.728 --> 01:11:16.799
Go around the back.

01:11:17.730 --> 01:11:18.929
Don't let her escape!

01:11:36.683 --> 01:11:37.820
I'm not gonna hurt you.

01:12:34.941 --> 01:12:36.879
The fuck?

01:14:37.029 --> 01:14:38.297
Chancellor, this is The Eye.

01:14:40.404 --> 01:14:42.210
What is it?

01:14:42.278 --> 01:14:44.435
The outsider
has not been contained.

01:14:45.975 --> 01:14:47.482
<i> Engage full protocols.</i>

01:16:10.131 --> 01:16:11.093
Find her!

01:17:20.969 --> 01:17:22.062
Ah.

01:17:22.130 --> 01:17:23.902
You're having
a little tea party.

01:17:27.743 --> 01:17:30.568
Aren't you going to say hello
to your grandfather?

01:17:31.245 --> 01:17:32.573
Where is Daddy?

01:17:32.642 --> 01:17:33.813
Is he okay?

01:17:37.047 --> 01:17:40.921
You have no idea, Ella,
how worried I was.

01:17:40.990 --> 01:17:41.986
All of us.

01:17:47.492 --> 01:17:48.861
Your father...

01:17:49.727 --> 01:17:53.059
well, he broke our customs.

01:17:53.128 --> 01:17:54.966
He was trying
to take you away.

01:17:55.764 --> 01:17:57.732
Away from me.

01:17:57.800 --> 01:17:59.300
Away from your family.

01:17:59.966 --> 01:18:01.302
I hate you.

01:18:03.612 --> 01:18:06.739
That hate will make
you strong, Ella.

01:18:06.808 --> 01:18:08.342
I hate you.

01:18:11.484 --> 01:18:12.478
Chancellor.

01:18:17.984 --> 01:18:19.056
We got her.

01:18:20.195 --> 01:18:21.190
Is she dead?

01:18:22.957 --> 01:18:24.127
She's Ruska Roma.

01:18:24.761 --> 01:18:26.327
She has their mark.

01:18:57.226 --> 01:18:59.591
You know,
I met your Director once.

01:19:00.635 --> 01:19:02.429
It was many years ago
in Moscow.

01:19:04.032 --> 01:19:06.103
Not a very pleasant lady.

01:19:06.172 --> 01:19:11.010
But we did have a respectful
conversation, nonetheless.

01:19:11.078 --> 01:19:15.442
A shared understanding of
the roles that we both play...

01:19:15.511 --> 01:19:18.584
and, more importantly,
the roles that we don't play.

01:19:18.653 --> 01:19:20.478
The Director
didn't send me here.

01:19:20.547 --> 01:19:22.416
The Ruska Roma
has nothing to do with this.

01:19:23.688 --> 01:19:25.254
Well, it does now.

01:19:33.159 --> 01:19:34.131
Why are you here?

01:19:36.004 --> 01:19:38.465
If you've come for the girl,
you are gravely mistaken.

01:19:39.441 --> 01:19:41.541
Ella is my granddaughter.

01:19:41.610 --> 01:19:44.878
Someday,
all of this will be hers.

01:19:45.377 --> 01:19:46.737
My son,

01:19:47.610 --> 01:19:49.012
well...

01:19:49.081 --> 01:19:51.951
he tried to deprive her
of her true heritage.

01:19:53.083 --> 01:19:55.548
You put a contract
on your own son?

01:19:57.220 --> 01:19:59.186
You may have noticed
we don't take well

01:19:59.254 --> 01:20:00.993
to outsiders
meddling in our town.

01:20:02.689 --> 01:20:06.658
This is where people
like yourself come to live,

01:20:07.402 --> 01:20:09.331
to have real lives.

01:20:10.273 --> 01:20:12.169
To raise families.

01:20:14.972 --> 01:20:17.768
Would you not like to someday

01:20:18.744 --> 01:20:20.243
have a family of your own?

01:20:20.810 --> 01:20:22.413
I had a family!

01:20:22.482 --> 01:20:24.179
I was a child.

01:20:24.248 --> 01:20:27.383
Men came into my house.
Men from your tribe.

01:20:27.452 --> 01:20:28.550
Ah.

01:20:28.618 --> 01:20:29.615
I see.

01:20:31.118 --> 01:20:32.986
This is about vengeance.

01:20:33.054 --> 01:20:34.724
They killed my father

01:20:34.792 --> 01:20:36.358
and tried to take me.

01:20:39.896 --> 01:20:41.198
Tried to take you?

01:20:49.941 --> 01:20:52.704
Fate is a very humbling thing.

01:21:13.269 --> 01:21:14.592
What is it?

01:21:14.660 --> 01:21:17.696
Well, she...
she wasn't working for Pine.

01:21:19.841 --> 01:21:22.376
She's here because
I killed her father

01:21:22.444 --> 01:21:23.911
when she was a child.

01:21:26.844 --> 01:21:28.047
She's your sister.

01:21:29.976 --> 01:21:31.485
No.

01:21:31.554 --> 01:21:33.844
For God's sake!

01:21:42.456 --> 01:21:43.524
What are you doing?

01:21:47.125 --> 01:21:48.100
Lena!

01:22:38.744 --> 01:22:40.779
All this time,
I thought you were dead.

01:22:42.415 --> 01:22:43.815
What are you talkin' about?

01:22:48.092 --> 01:22:49.821
You don't remember me, do you?

01:22:53.634 --> 01:22:55.134
You were born here, Eve.

01:22:56.471 --> 01:22:57.631
We both were.

01:22:59.774 --> 01:23:02.339
My little sister
has come home.

01:23:05.881 --> 01:23:07.839
When I was younger,
I used to wonder...

01:23:09.477 --> 01:23:12.380
"Why did he take you
and not me?"

01:23:12.449 --> 01:23:15.984
I mean, later I realized
it was too late for me.

01:23:16.053 --> 01:23:17.618
I'd already taken a life.

01:23:19.823 --> 01:23:20.819
But you...

01:23:23.129 --> 01:23:24.829
He thought
he could raise you

01:23:24.898 --> 01:23:26.598
with no memory of this place,

01:23:26.667 --> 01:23:28.365
of your true home.

01:23:29.929 --> 01:23:31.797
But I guess it never
leaves your blood, does it?

01:23:32.639 --> 01:23:33.634
In the end,

01:23:34.609 --> 01:23:36.003
we are who we are.

01:23:36.072 --> 01:23:37.308
We are not the same.

01:23:39.140 --> 01:23:40.377
Your people...

01:23:41.781 --> 01:23:43.108
killed my father.

01:23:43.177 --> 01:23:44.374
Our father. Yes.

01:23:44.443 --> 01:23:45.886
For betraying us.

01:23:45.955 --> 01:23:49.385
And then our mother
had to pay the price.

01:23:49.454 --> 01:23:51.619
The Chancellor was trying
to save you that night.

01:23:52.928 --> 01:23:54.253
He was trying
to bring you back home,

01:23:54.321 --> 01:23:55.523
as he would with anyone.

01:23:55.592 --> 01:23:58.221
My father was trying
to give me a normal life!

01:23:59.933 --> 01:24:01.802
Well, he would be very proud.

01:24:01.871 --> 01:24:03.131
You're forcing children
into this life!

01:24:03.199 --> 01:24:05.095
As Ruska Roma has with you.

01:24:05.164 --> 01:24:06.433
No!

01:24:06.502 --> 01:24:08.771
She gave me a choice!
I chose this!

01:24:08.840 --> 01:24:09.868
Oh, did you?

01:24:11.970 --> 01:24:14.345
Or did fate just find
another path for you?

01:24:21.716 --> 01:24:24.322
At least here we're honest
about who we are.

01:24:25.286 --> 01:24:26.885
No Kikimora lies.

01:24:31.226 --> 01:24:32.396
We've got eyes on her.

01:24:34.899 --> 01:24:35.894
<i> Cabin 83.</i>

01:24:38.797 --> 01:24:40.899
She's inside
with Lena, sir, talking.

01:24:44.513 --> 01:24:45.673
Take them out.

01:24:46.579 --> 01:24:47.576
<i> Sir?</i>

01:24:51.014 --> 01:24:52.119
Kill them both.

01:24:57.717 --> 01:24:59.588
You heard The Chancellor.
Blow it.

01:25:42.237 --> 01:25:45.238
I was only nine when they
told us you were dead.

01:25:46.103 --> 01:25:47.273
Save your breath.

01:25:50.403 --> 01:25:51.937
I missed you.

01:26:10.824 --> 01:26:11.957
<i> Everyone, move in.</i>

01:26:22.502 --> 01:26:23.672
<i> Check for survivors.</i>

01:26:56.439 --> 01:26:58.108
THE CHANCELLOR:<i> Strike team...</i>

01:26:58.176 --> 01:27:00.544
<i> Strike team, do you copy?</i>

01:27:05.214 --> 01:27:06.253
<i> Is it done?</i>

01:27:16.163 --> 01:27:17.990
This isn't done
until you're dead.

01:27:32.910 --> 01:27:34.342
<i> Yes?</i>

01:27:34.411 --> 01:27:37.350
We have a problem, you and I.

01:27:39.020 --> 01:27:41.085
And what problem
might that be?

01:27:41.153 --> 01:27:42.616
That a member of your tribe

01:27:42.685 --> 01:27:45.686
has contravened
a centuries old truce.

01:27:45.754 --> 01:27:49.087
The Ruska Roma
have no desire for a war.

01:27:50.997 --> 01:27:53.122
Especially not with you.

01:27:53.191 --> 01:27:54.592
<i> Whether you sent her or not</i>

01:27:54.661 --> 01:27:56.432
<i> is of no interest to me.</i>

01:27:56.501 --> 01:27:58.298
<i> You will accept</i>
<i> full consequences</i>

01:27:58.366 --> 01:27:59.539
<i> of her actions.</i>

01:27:59.608 --> 01:28:01.005
Which are?

01:28:01.073 --> 01:28:02.934
The end of your tribe.

01:28:03.003 --> 01:28:05.873
Your students,
your fucking pets, everything.

01:28:06.847 --> 01:28:09.138
Call her off.

01:28:09.207 --> 01:28:11.312
<i> Chancellor, she's operating</i>

01:28:11.380 --> 01:28:13.977
<i> against Ruska Roma.</i>

01:28:14.045 --> 01:28:16.455
I could not call her off
if I tried.

01:28:17.782 --> 01:28:20.151
Then war it shall be.

01:28:22.020 --> 01:28:25.198
Perhaps an agreement
could be struck.

01:28:25.266 --> 01:28:27.631
I can send someone
to solve the problem.

01:28:29.034 --> 01:28:30.627
Someone capable.

01:28:30.696 --> 01:28:31.965
No more bloodshed.

01:28:33.106 --> 01:28:34.737
<i> If you agree to this,</i>

01:28:34.806 --> 01:28:38.870
<i> you must also agree</i>
<i> that your men will not engage.</i>

01:28:38.938 --> 01:28:41.544
If come midnight
she still breathes,

01:28:41.613 --> 01:28:44.978
retaliation will be
inevitable and total.

01:28:46.078 --> 01:28:49.419
And if the problem
is taken care of?

01:28:49.487 --> 01:28:53.921
Then I will reconsider
my response.

01:28:55.161 --> 01:28:57.428
THE DIRECTOR:<i> Very well.</i>

01:28:57.497 --> 01:28:59.828
<i> I will, of course,</i>
<i> need your location.</i>

01:29:02.260 --> 01:29:05.097
